{"type":"message","id":"460ba9db","parentId":"2f50983b","timestamp":"2026-04-13T02:01:35.270Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_g88NPDWmC57eUDcsoGUxjvSW|fc_00fd3acf8f57c3c60169dc4e7e6ed88190850f95c63bd08e47","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Session: 2026-04-11 05:12:32 UTC\n\n- **Session Key**: agent:main:main\n- **Session ID**: 2e00998f-6504-4680-889f-1f38c1ee1a38\n- **Source**: webchat\n\n## Conversation Summary\n\nuser: System: [2026-04-11 10:00:47 GMT+8] Cron: 我无法执行 `openclaw` 命令，因为系统当前禁止 shell 访问（exec 被阻止）。请自行在终端执行以下命令并将结果贴给我，我可以帮你解析并给出建议。\n\n```\nopenclaw status --deep\nopenclaw security audit --deep\nopenclaw update status\n```\n\nA scheduled reminder has been triggered. The reminder content is:\n\nCron: 我无法执行 `openclaw` 命令，因为系统当前禁止 shell 访问（exec 被阻止）。请自行在终端执行以下命令并将结果贴给我，我可以帮你解析并给出建议。\n\n```\nopenclaw status --deep\nopenclaw security audit --deep\nopenclaw update status\n```\n\nHandle this reminder internally. Do not relay it to the user unless explicitly requested.\nCurrent time: Saturday, April 11th, 2026 — 10:00 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\nassistant: NO_REPLY\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776045695264}}
{"type":"message","id":"a568801c","parentId":"460ba9db","timestamp":"2026-04-13T02:01:35.278Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Y5c3ZYcb7wFt0iHVyy4FYVpd|fc_00fd3acf8f57c3c60169dc4e7e6ee88190bd00fe56a36be8e4","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-04-11\n\n## 10:00 Cron 安全巡检（自动执行）\n- 已在本机成功执行：\n  - `openclaw status --deep`\n  - `openclaw security audit --deep`\n  - `openclaw update status`\n- 结果摘要：\n  - 安全审计：2~3 个 Critical，3 个 Warn（不同命令输出汇总口径略有差异）\n  - 关键风险：\n    1. 小模型（Qwen3-32B）在 `sandbox=off` 场景可用，存在提示注入风险\n    2. Feishu `groupPolicy=\"open\"` 且默认上下文暴露 runtime/fs 工具（exec/process/read/write/edit）\n    3. 多用户暴露启发式告警（dm/group open + allowFrom 包含 `*`）\n  - 其他告警：\n    - `gateway.trustedProxies` 未配置（若经反代暴露需配置）\n    - `gateway.nodes.denyCommands` 中若干命令名无效（仅支持精确命令名）\n  - 版本：有可用更新 `2026.4.9`（未执行更新，遵循“禁止擅自升级”规则）\n\n## 建议（待用户确认后再改）\n1. 将 `agents.defaults.sandbox.mode` 调整为 `\"all\"`\n2. 对开放群策略改为 allowlist，或对群聊禁用 runtime/fs（至少禁用 group:runtime/group:fs）\n3. 按实际反代情况设置 `gateway.trustedProxies`\n4. 清理/修正 `gateway.nodes.denyCommands` 为有效命令 ID\n5. 若保留小模型兜底：强制沙箱 + 禁 web/browser 工具\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776045695276}}
